<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In See&amp;Trek: Training-Free Spatial Prompting for Multimodal Large Language Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
